PE 784: Reciprocal Pairs / 互反对

=== Egyptian fractions: 1/x + 1/y = 1/n ===
  n= 1:    1 solutions (e.g., 2+2)
  n= 2:    3 solutions (e.g., 3+6, 4+4)
  n= 3:    3 solutions (e.g., 4+12, 6+6)
  n= 4:    5 solutions (e.g., 5+20, 6+12, 8+8)
  n= 5:    3 solutions (e.g., 6+30, 10+10)
  n= 6:    9 solutions (e.g., 7+42, 8+24, 9+18, ...)
  n= 7:    3 solutions (e.g., 8+56, 14+14)
  n= 8:    7 solutions (e.g., 9+72, 10+40, 12+24, ...)
  n= 9:    5 solutions (e.g., 10+90, 12+36, 18+18)
  n=10:    9 solutions (e.g., 11+110, 12+60, 14+35, ...)
  n=11:    3 solutions (e.g., 12+132, 22+22)
  n=12:   15 solutions (e.g., 13+156, 14+84, 15+60, ...)

